Z||000001||SCCA FIERO||11-19-1999||11:32 PM||||You prolly already know this but... are you trying to put the knuckle over the shaft with the bolt in it? The bolt actually goes in a slot in the shaft. I'm sure you know this because you can't get the knuckle off the shaft unless you remove the bolt.<P>Also, there is a slot on the shaft that has to be aligned with the knuckle as well||||reg||1
